body:
New task T-0160 is assigned: make every dashboard route usable at 390px without page-level horizontal overflow.

Measured from the current production build at 390 x 844:
- every route: documentElement.scrollWidth 722 vs clientWidth 390, i.e. 332px horizontal overflow;
- Plan main region 8,990px, Attention 4,675px, Work items 4,661px, Reports 4,448px;
- Conversations has 97 focusable elements with no accessible name; Audit & barrier has 22; Kanban 9.

This cannot be solved by merely shrinking the desktop layout. Use the mobile patterns already provided by Element Plus (drawer/rail, responsive table behavior, scroll containment) and keep desktop behavior intact. Add a 390px Playwright gate for all routes plus accessible-name checks. Confirm receipt.
